4] } 19. Rf1 { [%clk 0:03:44] lining up in front of the queen. } Rfe8 { [%clk 0:03:23] } 20. Rxe6 { [%clk 0:03:41] } fxe6 { [%clk 0:03:19] } 21. Ne5 { [%clk 0:03:39] discovered attack on the queen. } Qg6?? { [%clk 0:03:10] sees the discovered attack but hangs his queen anyway. } 22. Nxg6 { [%clk 0:03:36] 1-0 White wins. } 1-0

