ot quite as spectacular. }) 18... Kxg8 { [%clk 0:03:12] } 19. Rh8+ { [%clk 0:02:40] } Kxh8 { [%clk 0:03:11] } 20. Qh5+ { [%clk 0:02:40] } Kg8 { [%clk 0:03:02] } 21. Qh7# { [%clk 0:02:40] 1-0 White wins. } 1-0

